<title>NETHERLANDS: ISPAT PRICES IPO AT $27 PER SHARE.</title>
<headline>ISPAT PRICES IPO AT $27 PER SHARE.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steel group Ispat International NV said on Thursday it had priced shares in its initial public offering (IPO) at $27 per share.</p>
</text>
